! Approved gismu Alterations on jbovlaste

See ((BPFK Section: gismu Issues)) for details on why this page exists.

* Added "[http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/natlang/en/arm|arm (weapon)]" to [http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/dict/xarci|xarci]
* Added "[http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/natlang/en/horizontal|horizontal]" to [http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/dict/pinta|pinta]
* Added a note to "kampu" about it being universal.  Added several keywords.
* Changed krici to say "regardless of evidence/proof" instead of "without evidence/proof".  Added believer to place 1, belief to place2 and faith as a gloss.
* barda: Added "large".
* bacru: Added "speak; phonate".
* bevri: Added "bring; transport".
* cabna: Added "present; pertaining to the current time", "concurrent; simultaneous".
* culno: Added "whole; entirety".
* gidva: Added "conduct; guide".
* jdima: Added "cost; amount of money".
* jersi: Added "follow; go/come after in physical space".
* jgari: Added "hold; grasp".
* jikca: Added "social; being extroverted/outgoing".
* jundi: Added "follow; keep track of some event/person", "mind; pay attention to".
* klesi: Added "type; class".
* klina: Added "direct; straight/constant without interruption"
* kuspe: Added "reach; touch by virtue of extent".
* merko: Added "U.S." as sense for "American"; added "U.S." and "USA".
* midju: Added "center; middle".
* muslo: Added Muslim, Moslem, Koranic, Quranic.
* platu: Added "measure; tactic/strategy".
* ralte: Added "hold; have and keep possession of", "keep; maintain possession of".
* rirci: Added "rirci; distinguished by a unique/unusual quality".
* sisti: Added "halt; cause something to stop", "stop; cause something to halt".
* sorcu: Added "hold; store".
* steci: Added "special; of particular interest/value", "particular; specific".
* tcidu: "document" for the x3, "text;readable" for the x2, and "reader;agentive" for the x1
* tcini: Added "condition; particular state of being".
* traji: Added "best; superlative", "least; superlative".
* vasru: Added "include; enclose".
* vitke: Added "visitor".
* vrude: Added "virtuous", 'Virtue is "ka vrude"'.
* zbasu: Added "buid;form by combining materials"
* zetro: Added "zetta".  Duh.
* zvati: Atemporal; location equivalent of {cabna}.